	(text "The reference has a socket for an eMMC module (sheet 25); this board has the chip soldered down.\nFrom the reference: 10K pull-ups on reset, data 0 and command to VCC_1V8_S3, 10 pF on the clock,\nthe 3.3 V flash supply from VCC_3V3_S3 and the 1.8 V interface supply from VCC_1V8_S3.\nAdded for a soldered chip (these sit inside the module on the reference): the 1 uF capacitor on VDDI\nand 100 nF capacitors at the supply balls. Check both against the chosen chip's datasheet.\nSymbol: Samsung KLMBG2JETD-B041 (32 GB). Any JEDEC 153-ball eMMC 5.1 chip fits the same footprint."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 15 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.5 1.5)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "ccdc21c6-d538-56e6-927c-9d25e8c8d7b6")
	)
